  captions: [[0.0, "Two teams line up on the west sideline: blue north of the cone, red south of it. The coach stands just behind the cone."], [0.6, "The coach rolls a ball out, about 9 yards along the 20-yard line."], [1.0, "Two red players and one blue player, the ones closest to the cone, go for it."], [2.3, "They fight for the ground ball."], [2.9, "Red scoops it. 2 red against 1 blue, so blue is a player down. Whoever has the ball is on offense now, and shoots when there is a shot."], [7.9, "Red has a shot and takes it: goal!"], [10.9, "A coach throws in a new ball (\"New ball!\") and the coach at the cone calls \"Release!\": the next player from each team joins. Now 3 red against 2 blue, so blue is a player down. Everyone goes for the ball."], [17.9, "Blue scoops it up and is on offense."], [23.9, "Blue has a shot and takes it, but it goes wide and rolls behind."], [27.9, "A coach throws in a new ball (\"New ball!\") and the coach at the cone calls \"Release!\": the next player from each team joins. Now 4 red against 3 blue, so blue is a player down. Everyone goes for the ball."], [32.9, "Red scoops it up and is on offense."], [36.9, "Red has a shot and takes it: goal!"], [39.9, "A coach throws in a new ball (\"New ball!\") and the coach at the cone calls \"Release!\": the next player from each team joins. Now 5 red against 4 blue, so blue is a player down. Everyone goes for the ball."], [46.9, "Blue scoops it up and is on offense."], [57.9, "Blue has a shot and takes it: goal!"], [60.27, "The coach calls \"Reset!\" and everyone goes back to the lines."]],
